          "text": "Abantu bamwi basyeede, bapaizi, aba-Levi, abasimilyango, abasikwiimba, aba-Netinimu, aboonse ibakalyaandaanya abamasi kukubamba milao ya-Leza, abanakazi babo abana babo balombe abana babo basimbi, boonse ibakajisi luzibo akuswiilila, ",
